  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1202.01 Federal Requirements Incorporated",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1202.01 Federal Requirements Incorporated. Except as specified in Env-Hw 1202.02, the federal land disposal requirements in 40 CFR Part 268 are incorporated by reference, including the applicable test methods identified in 40 CFR 260.11(c)(4) that are published in “Test Methods for Evaluating Solid Waste, Physical/Chemical Methods,” EPA publication SW-846, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #12354, eff 8-14-17; ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #13406, eff 7-23-22; ss by #14285, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
